      "p0001-n0014-l0004"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      1
    ],
    "text": "By employing modular collaboration and structural nesting, we combined these models into a multi-level ensemble model to analyze the regression and progress of each country in 2028. This approach further explores the relationship between countries and sports and identi\ufb01es advantageous projects for each country. Additionally, we modeled the impact of new events selected by the host country on the 2028 medal table projections."
  },
